Review Body:
I was disappointed that:
1) The author is not speaking;
2) there is no index or other guide to the contents of the discs;
3) the CDs are numbered, but no description of which chapters are on which disc;
4) it is difficult, especially given the content, to go back and listen again to certain parts, because the chapters are not indicate on the CDs nor is there any accompanying guide to the readings.

Disappointed with the presentation, but not with the original material. I found the presentation rather slipshod and catchpenny given the price and comparing it to other audio books I have used. I wish it were better thought through in the compilation and that there was an index or at least a guide to chapters with their titles and which CD they are on.
